{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Blessed be YHWH who has not forsaken His kindness.</b> As a sign that He performed kindness at the beginning with Elimelech and with his sons, for he was a judge." "<b>The living.</b> Naomi and Ruth. <b>Our redeemer is He.</b> The redemption is not levirate marriage, but it is another way."], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:26.987192514Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}